{
    "title": "Millionaire Quiz: Trivia Games",
    "description": "Millionaire Quiz is a fun and entertaining game where you can test your IQ, memory, and general knowledge, show off your intelligence, education, and prove that you are clever!\r\nPlay Millionaire Quiz is a Logic Brain Game. Questions & Answers - general knowledge trivia is a very interesting and popular trivia game. In this game you can proof that you are clever and train your brain! Choose the correct answer from 4 possible ones. Tons of questions are waiting.\r\n\r\nWhere is the highest mountain in the world? Or what bird has wings but can't fly?  In this trivia game, you will find answers for many interesting, curious and rare questions.\r\nMillionaire Quiz is especially fun to play with the whole family.  Learn general knowledge lets you experience the thrilling excitement of fighting for the grand prize of one million through 15 challenging trivia puzzles. Game is ready for all world languages.\r\nIf you don't know answer then don't worry we will help you by help options. So you can keep learning in our trivia game. Our main aim is play & learn.\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n\u2022 More than 10,000 questions and answers from many areas, categories and difficulty levels that are updated weekly.\r\n\u2022 Practice concentration, memory and attention skills.\r\n\u2022 Learn a lot of new knowledge with daily challenges that only the smartest people can do.\r\n\u2022 Standard four lifelines: public help, hide two wrong answers, celebrity advice, and question replacement.\r\n\u2022 Unlock new cities and travel the world for new Millionaire Quiz experiences!\r\n\u2022 Play & win Millionaire Quiz on the go with our offline mode!\r\nIt is the best quiz game available so far.\r\nBest trivia quiz game for the whole world. Play & Improve your general knowledge. Challenge game.\r\nEnjoy the Millionaire Quiz. Good luck! Be a star, trivia star!\r\nNote: We don't offer real cash through this game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Millionaire Quiz is a fun and entertaining game where you can test your IQ, memory, and general knowledge, show off your intelligence, education, and prove that you are clever!<br>Play Millionaire Quiz is a Logic Brain Game. Questions &amp; Answers - general knowledge trivia is a very interesting and popular trivia game. In this game you can proof that you are clever and train your brain! Choose the correct answer from 4 possible ones. Tons of questions are waiting.<br><br>Where is the highest mountain in the world? Or what bird has wings but can&#39;t fly?  In this trivia game, you will find answers for many interesting, curious and rare questions.<br>Millionaire Quiz is especially fun to play with the whole family.  Learn general knowledge lets you experience the thrilling excitement of fighting for the grand prize of one million through 15 challenging trivia puzzles. Game is ready for all world languages.<br>If you don&#39;t know answer then don&#39;t worry we will help you by help options. So you can keep learning in our trivia game. Our main aim is play &amp; learn.<br>GAME FEATURES:<br>\u2022 More than 10,000 questions and answers from many areas, categories and difficulty levels that are updated weekly.<br>\u2022 Practice concentration, memory and attention skills.<br>\u2022 Learn a lot of new knowledge with daily challenges that only the smartest people can do.<br>\u2022 Standard four lifelines: public help, hide two wrong answers, celebrity advice, and question replacement.<br>\u2022 Unlock new cities and travel the world for new Millionaire Quiz experiences!<br>\u2022 Play &amp; win Millionaire Quiz on the go with our offline mode!<br>It is the best quiz game available so far.<br>Best trivia quiz game for the whole world. Play &amp; Improve your general knowledge. Challenge game.<br>Enjoy the Millionaire Quiz. Good luck! Be a star, trivia star!<br>Note: We don&#39;t offer real cash through this game.",
